$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM (E)-(3R,4S)-8-(4-Methoxybenzyloxy)-3-methylocta-1,5-dien-4-ol (7). To a
suspension of titanium complex CpTiCl((S,S)-TADDOL) (4.28 g, 6.99 mmol,
1.6 equiv) in Et2O (56 mL) at 0°C was added dropwise a solution of
2-butenylmagnesium chloride (11.4 mL, 0.5 M in THF, 5.68 mmol, 1.3
equiv). After 2 h at 0°C, the resulting solution of crotyltitanium
complex (S,S)-Ti-I was cooled to -78°C, and a solution of aldehyde 6 (962
mg, 4.37 mmol) in Et2O (14 mL) was added dropwise. After 4 h at -78°C,
the reaction was quenched by addition of H2O (28 mL), the reaction
mixture was warmed to rt and vigorously stirred for a further 48 h. The
resulting mixture was filtered through Celite (Et2O), the layers of the
filtrate were separated and the aqueous phase was extracted with Et2O.
The combined organic extracts were washed with brine, dried over MgSO4,
filtered and concentrated under reduced pressure. Analysis of the crude
material by 1H NMR indicated the formation of 7 with high
diastereoselectivity (dr > 99/1). The crude material was purified by
flash chromatography on silica gel (petroleum ether/Et2O gradient: 80/20
to 50/50) to provide 1.16 g (96%) of alcohol 7 as a colorless oil.
(E)-(3R,4S)-8-(4-Methoxybenzyloxy)-3-methylocta-1,5-dien-4-ol (7) yield
96%, 1.16g [α]D +17.9 (c 0.905, CHCl3); IR 3444, 1613, 1586, 1513, 1462,
1362, 1302, 1247, 1174, 1093, 1035, 971, 914, 821 cm-1; 1H NMR (400 MHz,
CDCl3) δ 7.25 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 2H), 6.87 (d, J = 8.7 Hz, 2H), 5.79-5.72
(m, 1H), 5.68 (dtd, J = 15.4 Hz, J = 6.7 Hz and J = 0.6 Hz, 1H), 5.51
(ddt, J = 15.4 Hz, J = 7.1 Hz and J = 1.2 Hz, 1H), 5.14-5.09 (m, 2H),
4.43 (s, 2H), 3.81 (apparent br t, J = 7.6 Hz, 1H), 3.79 (s, 3H), 3.49
(t, J = 6.8 Hz, 2H), 2.36 (apparent qd, J = 6.8 Hz and J = 1.2 Hz, 2H),
2.27- 2.18 (m, 1H), 1.78 (br d, J = 2.6 Hz, 1H, OH), 0.98 (d, J = 6.8 Hz,
3H); 13C NMR (100 MHz, CDCl3) δ 159.1 (s), 140.5 (d), 132.6 (d), 130.5
(s), 129.6 (d), 129.2 (d, 2C), 116.2 (t), 113.7 (d, 2C), 76.1 (d), 72.5
(t), 69.4 (t), 55.2 (q), 44.3 (d), 32.7 (t), 16.0 (q); HRMS calcd for
C17H24O3Na (M+Na+): 299.16177. Found: 299.16137.
