$DATUM (4R,7R,5E)-7-Methoxymethoxy-7-methyl-8-triisopropylsilyloxy-octa-1,5-dien-4-ol
(16)2: To a mixture of (R)-p-tol-BINAP (373 mg, 0.55 mmol) and AgF (69.8
mg, 0.55 mmol) in MeOH (9 mL), 8 (910 mg, 2.75 mmol) and
allyltrimethoxysilane (0.7 mL, 4.13 mmol) were added at -20 °C under
protection from light. After 2 h, satd. NH4Cl aq. was added and the
product was extracted with CH2Cl2. The combined organic layer was washed
with brine and dried over Na2SO4. Filtration, evaporation, and
purification through silica gel column chromatography (AcOEt/hexane = 1/5
to 1/3) gave diastereomerically pure 16 in 80% yield (823 mg).
(4R,7R,5E)-7-Methoxymethoxy-7-methyl-8-triisopropylsilyloxy-octa-1,5-dien-4-ol
(16)2, yield (823 mg, 80%) 1H NMR (500 MHz, C6D6) δ: 1.1 (m, 21H), 1.46
(s, 3H), 2.22 (br t, J= 6.4 Hz, 2H), 3.27 (s, 3H), 3.74 (m, 2H), 4.00 (m,
1H), 4.69 (d, J = 7.0 Hz, 1H), 4.80 (d, J = 7.0 Hz, 1H), 5.03 (m, 2H),
5.78 (m, 3H); 13C NMR (126 MHz, C6D6) δ: 12.3, 18.2, 21.6, 42.5, 55.1,
71.1, 71.5, 79.0, 92.0, 117.7, 133.0, 134.5, 134.9; IR (neat, cm-1);
3415, 1115, 1037; MS m/z [α]25 D -12.2 (c 0.18, CHCl3).
