$DATUM (Z)-3-Hydroxy-6-methyl-4-phenyl-5-trifluoromethyloct-4-ene (2c). A
solution of enol ether 3 (220 mg, 1 mmol), sec-butyllithium (1.6 mL of a
1.5 M solution in hexanes, 2.1 mmol), and TMEDA (490 mg, 2.1 mmol) in
hexane (10 mL), after addition of propanal (70 mg, 1.2 mmol), afforded,
after workup and purification, the alcohol 2c (232 mg, 82%). IR (neat)
3450, 1630 cm-1; 19F NMR δ -52.0 (s); 1H NMR δ 0.65 (t, J = 7 Hz) and 0.7
(t, J = 7 Hz) (CH3), 0.9 (m, J = 7. Hz, 6 H), 1.40 (m, 4 H), 2.20 (m,
CH(CH3)), 4.7 (m, CHOH), 7.2 (m, 5H); 13C NMR δ 10.1/10.2, 12.4/12.5,
18.3/18.9, 27.1/27.3, 27.9, 38.1, 71.8 (q, 4 JCF = 2.7 Hz), 125.0 (q, 1
JCF = 292 Hz, CF3), 127.4, 127.7, 127.9, 128.2, 128.3, 129.4, 132.8 (m,
CCF3), 136.1/136.6, 150.0 (q, 3 JCF = 5.5 Hz). Anal. Calcd for C16H21F3O:
C, 67.13; H, 7.34. Found: C, 67.25; H, 7.33.
