0.8 Hz, 1H, C(2b)H), 1.26 (dt, J = 11.7, 7.0 Hz, 6H, C(7)H3 x 2); 13C{1H}
NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) δ ; 144.7 C(1'), 143.4 C(3), 128.4 C(2'), 127.3
C(4'), 125.9 C(3'), 117.8 C(4), 104.7 C(5), 73.8 C(1), 63.0 C(6a), 62.6
C(6b), 42.1 (2), 15.22 C(7a), 15.18 C(7b); IR (neat) 3429 (w), 3029 (w),
2976 (w), 2878 (w), 1651 (w), 1606 (w), 1494 (w), 1453 (w), 1393 (w),
1329 (w), 1162 (w), 1111 (w), 1053 (m), 1007 (w), 976 (w), 916 (w), 757
(w), 699 (m); MS (ESI) 273.3 (MNa+, 4), 147.2 (14), 146.2 (32), 123.3
(11), 116.3 (16), 115.3 (100), 107.1 (95); TLC Rf 0.24 (EtOAc/ hexane,
1:4) [UV, PA]. Anal. Calcd for C15H22O3 (250.34): C, 71.97; H, 8.86.
Found: C, 72.17; H, 8.87.
