$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Compound S-2 (1.0 g, 7.03 mmol) was dissolved in THF (25 mL), and cooled
to 0 °C. To this solution was added slowly PhMgCl (9 ml, 1 M in THF), and
the resulting solution was stirred for 2 min at 0 °C before addition of
water. The solution was extracted with ethyl acetate (three times),
concentrated under reduced pressure, and eluted through a silica column
(hexane/ethyl acetate: 10/1) to afford compound S-37 (1.50 g , 6.82 mmol,
97%).
