$DATUM (6E,10E)-2,6,11,15-tetramethyl-9-(phenylsulfonyl)hexadeca-2,6,10,14-tetraen-8-ol.
To a stirred solution of geranyl sulfone (4.54 g, 16.3 mmol) in THF (30
mL) was added a 1.6 M hexane solution of n-BuLi (11.2 mL, 17.9 mmol) at
-78 °C. The mixture was stirred at that temperature for 1 h, and a
solution of geranyl aldehyde (2.48 g, 16.3 mmol) in THF (5 mL) was added.
Stirring for 2 h at -78 °C, the mixture was diluted with EtOAc, washed
with 10% NH4Cl solution, dried over anhyd Na2SO4, filtered, and
concentrated under reduced pressure. The crude product was purified by
SiO2 flash chromatography to give the coupling product (6.73 g, 15.6
mmol) in 96% yield.
(6E,10E)-2,6,11,15-tetramethyl-9-(phenylsulfonyl)hexadeca-2,6,10,14-tetraen-8-ol,
yield (6.73 g, 15.6 mmol, 96%). 1H NMR δ 1.13 (m, 3H), 1.56 (s, 3H), 1.58
(s, 3H), 1.65 (s, 3H), 1.68 (s, 3H), 1.70 (s, 3H), 1.83-2.12 (m, 8H),
3.93 (dd, J = 10.8, 8.0 Hz, 1H), 3.97 (s, 1H), 4.79 (d, J = 10.8 Hz, 1H),
4.98-5.10 (m, 4H), 7.50-7.58 (m, 2H), 7.61-7.68 (m, 1H), 7.83-7.90 (m,
2H) ppm; 13C NMR δ 18.7, 19.4, 19.9, 27.7, 27.9, 27.9, 28.5, 28.7, 41.8,
41.9, 69.1, 72.3, 115.9, 124.8, 125.7, 125.9, 131.1, 131.4, 134.0, 134.3,
136.0, 140.0, 143.4, 147.4 ppm; IR (KBr) 3503, 2916, 1728, 1666, 1450,
1373, 1296, 1141, 1080, 740, 694 cm-1.
