0.9, 7.2 Hz, 1H), 3.77 (d, J = 7.5, 1H), 3.64 (s, 3H), 2.50 (br, 1H); 13C
NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3): δ 172.9, 136.6, 134.8, 132.4, 129.2, 128.9, 128.6,
128.4, 128.1, 127.9, 126.7, 73.9, 58.2, 52.3. HRMS-EI C18H18O3 calc.
