(m, 10H), 6.50 (dd, J = 0.9, 15.9 Hz, 1H), 5.99 (dd, J = 6, 15.9 Hz, 1H),
4.86 (dd, J = 7.2, 8.7 Hz, 1H), 3.74 (d, J = 9.0 Hz, 1H), 3.68 (s, 3H),
3.29 (br, 1H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3): δ 173.7, 136.6, 135.3, 131.6,
128.8, 128.7, 128.5, 127.9, 127.7, 126.5, 74.1, 58.6, 52.3. HRMS-EI
C18H18O3 calc. 282.1256, found 282.1265. Diastereomeric ratio of 7f was
determined by measuring peak area of methyl protons.
